alert-name-scp096-face = State
alert-desc-scp096-face-base =
    This face... revolting and hideous. It displays current mental and physical state.
    ​[bold]When I think on it, something inside whispers...[/bold]
alert-desc-scp096-face-damage =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    Let my flesh bleed to dust—so long as not a single drop of their memory remains.
alert-desc-scp096-face-idle =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    In this silence is a whole universe of torment. They breathe, they laugh... and I smolder in a clenched cry. I wait for the spark.
alert-desc-scp096-face-rage =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    I AM THE RIPPING ABSCESS OF THE UNIVERSE!
    ​[color=red]MAY THEIR SOULS BURN INTO THE ETERNAL SKELETON OF MY HATRED![/color]
alert-desc-scp096-face-heating-up =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    > FACES BURN IN MY MEMORY <
    Their features are seared into my flesh! Every glance of theirs is a nail in the coffin of my peace! [color=red]I WILL TEAR THEM OUT FROM UNDER MY OWN SKIN![/color]
alert-desc-scp096-face-sleep =
    { alert-desc-scp096-face-base }
    Not sleep. Not rest. This is a gravity well of absolute, crystallized rage.
    Soon it will collapse. And a new Big Bang will be born... [color=red]made only of their screams.[/color]
